  "confidence": "high",
  "notes": "Two manual pages on one scan (rotated 90 degrees): P1 (audio, ref CA91001/CM808BP1) and P2 (control, ref CA91001/CM808BP2). Each side of each edge connector has its own label column (letters left, numbers right). P1: every stereo input and the output appear on both the number and letter contact of the same row (LEFT IN #8 on 1 and A, etc.); which is + and which is - is not drawn, so the port keys L / L/2, R / R/2 just mean number contact / letter contact. Channel order runs #8 at the top (1/A) to #1 (15-16/S-T). Differences between sides: P1-17 SHIELD GND vs P1-U NC. P2: CTL #1-#8 split across both sides, CANCEL on T, +25V on 21, CTL COM on 22, and Z drawn to a chassis-ground symbol. Legend: NC = not connected."
}
